# Source layout

Pages live in `src/pages/<Name>/`. Colocate UI used by that route only.

```
src/pages/Plan/PlanPage.tsx
src/pages/Settings/...
src/components/layout/Layout.tsx
src/hooks/useSdeData.ts
src/lib/cost.ts
src/stores/appStore.ts
```

- Shared chrome: `src/components/layout/`
- Shared widgets: `src/components/`
- No `src/features/`. No `index.ts` barrels.
- Import files directly, e.g. `@/pages/Plan/PlanPage`.
- Zustand for client state (`appStore`, `authStore`). TanStack Query for fetches.
- Do not add Immer, extra providers, or nested `components/hooks/lib` inside a page folder.
